ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sabía que tarde o temprano llegaría
el día de nuestro enfrentamiento,
ogro desalmado{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sapevo che questo giorno sarebbe
arrivato {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}e uno di voi, spiritacci
della malora, mi avrebbe trovata.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Si tu croyais arriver à me faire peur
en te déguisant en ogre, {{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}c'est raté.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}En plus, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}je m'y attendais !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}E così{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} pensi di potermi spaventare.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
travestendoti da spirito malvagio?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ti sbagli! {{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Sei troppo prevedibile!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} did that hurt?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Sometimes I
don't know my own strength.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Plus,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
you seem like a strong ogre.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ay,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} canın mı acıdı{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}? Bazen kendi
gücümü unutuyorum. Gerçi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}} güçlü{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
bir oni gibi görünüyorsun.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Es una pena que lo de tirar
habichuelas a los vecinos solo
esté bien visto una vez al año{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Se non ci tenessi alle buone
maniere, stai pur cert{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} che ti tirerei
addosso un bel po' di fagioli.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Keşke {{TAG:0005:0005:}} kasabasında her gün
insanlara fasulye atmak sosyal
olarak kabul{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}edilebilir {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}olsa...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Necesito lanzar unas cuantas
habichuelas para aliviar el estrés.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿Dónde están esos ogros?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}♪Was ist das für ein Aufruhr hier?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ein Oger steht an meiner Tür{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
und stürmt herein, oh wehe mir!♪
♪Doch flink ich meine Bohnen zück{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
und ihn bewerfe Stück für Stück,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
bis er vom Plane abgerückt.♪
♪Raus mit dem Bösen,
rein mit dem Glück!♪{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Das,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} äh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} war ein altes Volkslied.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Damit vertreibe ich mir die Zeit,
bis mich ein Oger heimsucht...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Tú también buscas ogros, cielín?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
No te relajes si no ves ninguno,
¡eso es lo que ellos esperan!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Fasulye atmak masum görünüyor{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
... ama sırada{{TAG:0000:0004:}} ne var? Domates
mi? Turşu mu? Bir{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} gün avokado{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
mu? İnsanların{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}birbirine
avokado attığı bir {{TAG:0005:0005:}} kasabasında
yaşamak istemiyorum.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}You're lucky I don't feel like
cleaning up a bunch of splattered
beans right now{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

TRANSLATION:
