şanslısın{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Yorulmak bilmeyen{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} oni {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
